  "description": {
    "text": "The Sun & Moon Trainer Kit: Alolan Sandslash & Alolan Ninetales, released in Italian on 20 April 2018, was the second kit of the Sun & Moon Series and the first whose cards keep the number and set logo of the card they reprint instead of kit ones; its Energy cards have no number or logo. Alolan Sandslash and Alolan Ninetales are new cards of the kit, and everything else is a reprint.\n\nThis set holds the reprints from the Alolan Sandslash half deck."
  },
